<mxCell id="o_wiring" value="&lt;b&gt;Not wired up yet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;send_message passes no LoopConfig, so the hooks (steps 7–12) exist but the app runs with the defaults: nothing blocks a call or asks for approval.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tools still run on the host: the Workspace protocol (ADR-004) is next." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
